    "title": "Duluth voters approve both school operating levies | Livestream | fox21online.com",
    "text": "Duluth voters approve both school operating levies\n- Updated\nDuluth voters approved both school operating levies, providing millions in additional funding as the district faces budget challenges. One levy will address a $3.9 million deficit and increase revenue by $8.3 million in later years. The second adds $3.4 million annually. Voters also approved increased distributions from Minnesota's Permanent School Fund, bringing Duluth about $250,000 more each year.",
